    h+='<line class="ax" x1="'+X(-R)+'" y1="'+Y(0)+'" x2="'+X(R)+'" y2="'+Y(0)+'"/><line class="ax" x1="'+X(0)+'" y1="'+Y(-R)+'" x2="'+X(0)+'" y2="'+Y(R)+'"/>';
    for(i=-R;i<=R;i++){if(i===0)continue;h+='<text class="tk" data-v="'+i+'" x="'+X(i)+'" y="'+r2(Y(0)+11)+'" text-anchor="middle">'+n_(i)+'</text><text class="tk" data-w="'+i+'" x="'+r2(X(0)-4)+'" y="'+r2(Y(i)+3.5)+'" text-anchor="end">'+n_(i)+'</text>';}
    h+='<text class="tk" x="'+r2(X(0)-4)+'" y="'+r2(Y(0)+11)+'" text-anchor="end">0</text><text class="axl" x="'+r2(X(R)+7)+'" y="'+r2(Y(0)+4)+'" text-anchor="middle">x</text><text class="axl" x="'+X(0)+'" y="'+r2(Y(R)-6)+'" text-anchor="middle">y</text>';
